hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19022","Haddathana Abd al-Rahman from Sufyan from Mansur from Hilal ibn Yasaf from Salama ibn Qays who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: When you perform wudu, blow out water from the nose, and when you clean with stones, make it odd."
"19023","Haddathana Jarir ibn Abd al-Hamid from Sufyan from Hilal from Salama ibn Qays who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: When you perform wudu, blow out water from the nose, and when you clean with stones, make it odd."
